{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture","title":"平台架构设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backstage-idp-architecture","title":"Backstage 驱动的 IDP 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/architecture/backstage-idp-architecture","wordCount":1211,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-api-contract-design","title":"平台 API 契约设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/architecture/platform-api-contract-design","wordCount":1194,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"golden-paths-templates","title":"黄金路径与模板工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/architecture/golden-paths-templates","wordCount":1396,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 平台架构设计\n\n本章深入 IDP 的技术架构层：Backstage 为核心的门户架构设计、平台 API 的契约与版本化策略、以及黄金路径模板工程的系统化实现。\n\n架构设计的最高目标不是技术优雅，而是将复杂度封装在明确的抽象边界之后。一个好的平台架构让流对齐团队只需关注业务逻辑——基础设施、安全合规、可观测性作为默认能力内嵌于模板之中。\n\n建议结合「平台工程」hub 的开发者门户与工具链章节对照阅读，本章聚焦于规模化场景下的架构决策与权衡。\n"}